      "content": "Wait, you're still doing the goblin thing. Seriously, I'm just trying to get this paper right for my PhD. Can you just give me the plain, professional rules for both styles without the metaphors? I need to be 100% sure about the distinction between APA and Chicago so I don't mess up my submission.",
